{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 55, :comments ["<b>And it shall be that whom you leave of them.</b> They will be for evil to you." "<b>For thorns in your eyes.</b> Pegs that bore out your eyes. The Targum of pegs is שִׂיכַיָּא." "<b>And for thorns in your sides.</b> The commentators explain it as a term for a hedge of thorns that fences you in, to shut and confine you so there is no going out or coming in." "<b>And they shall trouble you.</b> As its Targum renders."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:13:41.685488274Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}